      "html": "<section id=\"section-aipd-clients\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative items-center gap-20 pt-12 pb-32 max-md:pt-8 max-md:pb-10 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-1c6297c3><h2 class=\"text-reveal-pending logo-strip-heading pointer-events-auto m-0 w-full max-md:hidden text-center text-3xl font-normal text-slatecolor\"><span class=\"text-reveal-word\">Trusted</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">by</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">ambitious</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">teams</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">to</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">design</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">AI</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">products</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">people</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">use</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">daily.</span></h2><ul class=\"logo-strip__grid pointer-events-auto grid w-full gap-3 logo-strip__grid--four\"><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/google-2015-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Google\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/youtube-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"YouTube\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/revolut-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Revolut\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/tesco-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Tesco\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/dataiku-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"dataiku\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/sage-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Sage\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/choreograph-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"choreograph\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/smartly-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"SMARTLY.IO\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li></ul></section>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human",
        "data-v-c2ba827a": ""
      },
      "html": "<section id=\"section-aipd-intro\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-24 max-md:py-10 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-11 text-left\" data-v-c2ba827a><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl\" data-v-c2ba827a><span class=\"block text-spark\">What we do</span><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">What is AI product design?</span></h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--markdown flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-34ac1b0d><p>AI product design is the discipline of making probabilistic systems feel trustworthy and usable - designing for a product that is usually right, sometimes wrong, and always in need of an interface that helps people judge which is which. It covers agentic flows, model-in-the-loop prototypes, and the decision boundaries that keep a human in control.</p>\n<p>Fyntix approaches it from an unusual position: a design-led product agency in London that ships production AI. Our design heritage runs through brand and product work for Revolut, Simplestream and Oxford Quantum Circuits; the same craft is now applied to AI products in daily production use - the Creative Intelligence Agent we defined and piloted with Sage, the sales tooling used every day by 5,000 Google Cloud sellers, and the compliance engine that cut Tesco's creative reviews from four weeks to days.</p>\n<p>The difference is where design sits. Our designers work embedded with AI engineers in one team - our AI Product Squads pair both with product management - so agentic flows are prototyped against real model behaviour rather than static mockups, and the experience ships as designed. Explore the full <a href=\"/services\">AI consultancy &amp; product development services</a> behind the squads, or see how the same embedded team delivers <a href=\"/services/ai-agency\">automation, agents and AI software</a>. Weighing up studios first? See our review of the <a href=\"/feed/best-ai-product-design-agencies-in-london-2026\">best AI product design agencies in London</a>, or read how we treat a design system as infrastructure rather than an inventory in <a href=\"/feed/what-revoluts-design-system-taught-us-about-shipping-fast\">what Revolut's design system taught us about shipping fast</a>.</p>\n</div></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human"
      },
      "html": "<div class=\"w-full overflow-hidden bg-chalk\"><section id=\"section-aipd-pillars\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative gap-40 pt-40 pb-20 max-md:pt-20 max-md:pb-10 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-1c6297c3><h2 class=\"font-normal text-5xl\"><span class=\"text-spark\">Design that survives contact with the model</span><br><span class=\"text-slatecolor\">What AI product design covers at Fyntix - the UX architecture of agentic systems, prototypes wired to real models, and design craft proven long before AI.</span></h2><div class=\"grid-cols-3 grid w-full max-md:grid-cols-1 items-stretch max-md:gap-16 gap-24\"><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-start max-md:gap-6 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative max-md:size-80 size-72 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start max-md:gap-10 gap-8\"><h3 class=\"text-spark font-normal text-5xl\">AI UX architecture</h3><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Agentic flows, designed.</p><p class=\"text-haze-800 max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">We design the structure of agentic products - reasoning-aware paths, decision boundaries, and the moments where a human confirms, corrects or takes over - so the product earns trust when the model is wrong, not only when it is right.</p><div class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/sage-logo-evidence.gen.webp\" alt=\"Sage\" class=\"size-12 shrink-0 object-contain\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-normal leading-normal tracking-tight\">We defined &amp; piloted a creative intelligence agent with Sage to drive ads ROI.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-start max-md:gap-6 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative max-md:size-80 size-72 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start max-md:gap-10 gap-8\"><h3 class=\"text-spark font-normal text-5xl\">Model-in-the-loop prototyping</h3><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Tested on real behaviour.</p><p class=\"text-haze-800 max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Prototypes are wired to real model responses from the first sprint, so design decisions are tested against how the system actually behaves - latency, errors, confidence and all - before anything is committed to production.</p><div class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/_nuxt/google-cloud-evidence._xZJoMAR.svg\" alt=\"Google Cloud\" class=\"size-12 shrink-0 object-contain\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-normal leading-normal tracking-tight\">We design the AI products used daily by 5,000 Google Cloud sellers.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-start max-md:gap-6 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative max-md:size-80 size-72 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start max-md:gap-10 gap-8\"><h3 class=\"text-spark font-normal text-5xl\">Design heritage, applied to AI</h3><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Craft proven before AI.</p><p class=\"text-haze-800 max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Our designers built brand and product experiences for Revolut, Simplestream and Oxford Quantum Circuits before applying that craft to AI. The fundamentals - hierarchy, behaviour, trust - carry over; the systems they now shape are agentic.</p><div class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/revolut-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Revolut\" class=\"size-12 shrink-0 object-contain\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-normal leading-normal tracking-tight\">We helped launch Europe's fastest-growing tech brand with Revolut.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human",
        "data-v-be4afccd": ""
      },
      "html": "<div class=\"w-full bg-chalk\" data-v-be4afccd><section id=\"section-aipd-faq\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-be4afccd data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-12\" data-v-be4afccd><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\" data-v-be4afccd><h2 class=\"font-normal text-5xl\" data-v-be4afccd><span class=\"text-spark\">AI product design FAQs</span></h2><p class=\"max-w-3xl text-xl leading-snug tracking-tight text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd>Straight answers for teams evaluating an AI product design agency.</p></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col\" data-v-be4afccd><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>What is AI product design? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>AI product design is the practice of designing products built on probabilistic systems - shaping agentic flows, trust signals, and human control so people can rely on a product that is sometimes wrong. It spans UX architecture, interface design, and prototyping against real model behaviour.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>How is AI product design different from traditional UX design? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>A conventional app either works or it does not; an AI product gives answers that are usually right and sometimes wrong. That changes the design problem: you design for calibrated trust, graceful error recovery, visible reasoning and sources, and decision boundaries that keep a human in control of consequential actions.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>How do you design for model errors and trust? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>By setting honest expectations of what the system can do, showing confidence and sources so users can calibrate their trust, designing recovery paths for the moments the model is wrong, and keeping a human clearly in control. We prototype against real model responses, so these behaviours are designed from observed failures rather than imagined ones.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Do you build the AI as well as design it? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Yes - that is the core of the model. Designers and AI engineers work as one embedded squad, so the experience and the system are built together rather than reconciled after a handoff. It is why the products we design are in production: Sage's Creative Intelligence Agent, Google Cloud's seller tooling, and Tesco's compliance engine.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>What data readiness do we need before AI product design starts? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Less than most teams assume. Discovery and early design work with sample data, and model-in-the-loop prototypes surface data gaps early - which is far cheaper than finding them after a build. Design and data readiness progress together rather than one waiting on the other.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>How should we compare AI product design agencies? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Ask for production evidence, not portfolio shots - AI-washed portfolios are common. Check whether prototypes were wired to real models, whether designers sit in the same team as engineers, and whether the agency can point to shipped products with measurable outcomes and named clients.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Which industries do you design AI products for? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Recent AI product design work spans retail media with Tesco, business software with Sage, and cloud sales with Google Cloud, on top of product and brand heritage in fintech with Revolut, streaming with Simplestream, and quantum computing with Oxford Quantum Circuits.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Where is your AI product design agency based? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Our HQ is in Southwark, London - The Binary, 27 Copperfield Street, SE1 0EN. We work with clients across the UK and internationally, from scale-ups to global enterprises.</span></div></details></div></div></section></div>"
    },
